# Code owners for the release path.
#
# The owner is the single maintainer named in CODE_SIGNING_POLICY.md. Keep
# this handle resolvable: an unresolved handle matches nobody, so a
# required-review ruleset built on it would match zero reviewers and never be
# satisfiable.
#
# Rationale: these three paths together decide what leaves the repository
# and under what signature -- the release workflow (contents:write,
# id-token:write), the artifact/signing manifest, and the enterprise
# install/uninstall scripts that write service config and ACLs on the host.

/.github/workflows/release.yml @callumau
/.goreleaser.yaml @callumau
/installer/ @callumau
